<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background:#F7F5F0; font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;">

  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#F7F5F0; padding:40px 16px;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table width="520" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#fff; border-radius:16px; border:1px solid #DDD9D2; overflow:hidden; max-width:520px;">

          <%# Cabeçalho %>
          <tr>
            <td style="background:#0F3826; padding:24px 32px;">
              <div style="font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:800; color:#fff; letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Practice-BR</div>
              <div style="font-size:0.7rem; color:#6EBD96; margin-top:3px;">
                <% if @lang == "fr" %>Plateforme de Portugais pour Étrangers
                <% elsif @lang == "en" %>Portuguese Learning Platform
                <% else %>Plataforma de Português para Estrangeiros
                <% end %>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <%# Corpo %>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:28px 32px 8px;">
              <div style="font-size:1.8rem; margin-bottom:12px;">💳</div>

              <% if @lang == "fr" %>
                <div style="font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:700; color:#1C1917; margin-bottom:10px;">
                  Votre paiement n'est pas passé
                </div>
                <p style="font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.6; color:#5C5853; margin:0 0 14px;">
                  Bonjour <%= @student.display_name %>, votre banque a refusé le dernier
                  prélèvement. Ça arrive souvent — la plupart du temps c'est simplement une
                  carte expirée.
                </p>
                <p style="font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.6; color:#5C5853; margin:0 0 14px;">
                  <strong>Votre accès reste ouvert pendant <%= @days_left %> jour<%= "s" if @days_left != 1 %>.</strong>
                  Mettez votre moyen de paiement à jour et tout continue normalement.
                </p>
              <% elsif @lang == "en" %>
                <div style="font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:700; color:#1C1917; margin-bottom:10px;">
                  Your payment didn't go through
                </div>
                <p style="font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.6; color:#5C5853; margin:0 0 14px;">
                  Hi <%= @student.display_name %>, your bank declined the last charge. This
                  happens a lot — most of the time it's just an expired card.
                </p>
                <p style="font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.6; color:#5C5853; margin:0 0 14px;">
                  <strong>Your access stays open for <%= @days_left %> more day<%= "s" if @days_left != 1 %>.</strong>
                  Update your payment method and everything carries on as usual.
                </p>
              <% else %>
                <div style="font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:700; color:#1C1917; margin-bottom:10px;">
                  Seu pagamento não passou
                </div>
                <p style="font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.6; color:#5C5853; margin:0 0 14px;">
                  Oi <%= @student.display_name %>, o seu banco recusou a última cobrança.
                  Isso acontece bastante — na maioria das vezes é só cartão vencido.
                </p>
                <p style="font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.6; color:#5C5853; margin:0 0 14px;">
                  <strong>Seu acesso continua liberado por <%= @days_left %> dia<%= "s" if @days_left != 1 %>.</strong>
                  Atualize a forma de pagamento e tudo segue normal.
                </p>
              <% end %>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <%# Botão %>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:8px 32px 28px;">
              <a href="<%= @url %>"
                 style="display:inline-block; background:#1A6B4A; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; font-size:0.92rem; font-weight:700; padding:12px 26px; border-radius:10px;">
                <% if @lang == "fr" %>Mettre à jour le paiement
                <% elsif @lang == "en" %>Update payment
                <% else %>Atualizar pagamento
                <% end %>
              </a>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <%# Rodapé %>
          <tr>
            <td style="background:#F7F5F0; padding:18px 32px; border-top:1px solid #DDD9D2;">
              <p style="font-size:0.78rem; line-height:1.5; color:#9C9892; margin:0;">
                <% if @lang == "fr" %>
                  Un souci ou une question ? Répondez à cet email, on vous lit.
                <% elsif @lang == "en" %>
                  Trouble or questions? Just reply to this email — we read them.
                <% else %>
                  Deu algum problema ou ficou com dúvida? Responda este email que a gente lê.
                <% end %>
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
